--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad6b4272890c70c4eb3d3dfe4810ac24, type: 3}
  m_Name: D_Interlude_Market_01
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Morsoul.Dialogue::Morsoul.Dialogue.DialogueData
  id: D_Interlude_Market_01
  nodes:
  - id: ovan_greeting
    speakerName: Guildmaster Ovan
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: "\"Ah\u2014the Guild's own miracle worker. I had new audit protocols bound this morning, {PlayerName}. No vault ledger moves a single crate without two signatures ever again.\""
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: ovan_fraud
  - id: ovan_fraud
    speakerName: Guildmaster Ovan
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: '"Ignatius'' fraud cost us more than gold, but we''ll survive it. Honesty is a better collateral than pride."'
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: eliza_solvent
  - id: eliza_solvent
    speakerName: Eliza
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: '"Good. Because his solvent didn''t come from a market stall. Whoever brokered that deal knew exactly what they were feeding him."'
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: ovan_broker
  - id: ovan_broker
    speakerName: Guildmaster Ovan
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: (lowering his voice) "The broker, yes. My people traced the name to a dead counting house on the wharf. Empty rooms. He vanished before the week was out."
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: eliza_circle
  - id: eliza_circle
    speakerName: Eliza
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: '"That''s how these people work. The trail always runs cold the same way."'
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: ovan_vault
  - id: ovan_vault
    speakerName: Guildmaster Ovan
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: "\"Well\u2014if there's anything left to learn, it's down in that vault of his. We keep it sealed, but you two have standing access.\""
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: eliza_itch
  - id: eliza_itch
    speakerName: Eliza
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: (glancing toward the Iron Cellar Grate) "Then let's take one more look, partner. Something down there still itches at the back of my mind."
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: 
  startNodeId: ovan_greeting
  portraits: []
